          "criterion_analysis": "EVIDENCE_STATUS: PARTIAL\nThe DOM evidence supports that the agent is operating within ClinicalTrials.gov search and (in this evidenced state) has condition=type 2 diabetes, Study Status=Recruiting, and Study Location=United States applied. However, the required Phase 3 filter and newest-first sorting are not evidenced as applied in the provided DOM state. Because the stopping condition requires all three filters plus newest-first sorting visibly applied and then recording the first three results with required fields, this criterion cannot be fully satisfied from the evidence.\n\nOn constraints: there is no DOM evidence of prohibited actions like contacting a study, saving studies, or submitting information; \"Save\" is disabled in this state, and only navigation/filtering actions are reflected. But the agent also did not (in evidence) stop after meeting the stopping condition; instead, it appears the state does not yet meet the stopping condition (missing Phase 3 + sorting confirmation + missing recorded fields).",
